{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The pre-fix regression fails as expected: the first request callback aborts its phase, an app callback masks it, and the inner context remains active. I’m now adding a phase helper plus a per-pop collector so the normal public teardown methods still work independently while `AppContext.pop` can combine both phases safely."}}
